_pdbx_database_remark.id     700 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SHEET
THE CROSS-OVER CONNECTION BETWEEN STRANDS 1 AND 2 OF SHEET
S1E IS LEFT-HANDED.
THE BETA-SHEET OF THE INHIBITOR IS IRREGULAR , WITH
WELL-ORDERED WATER MOLECULES PROVIDING ALL BUT ONE
HYDROGEN-BONDING BRIDGE BETWEEN STRANDS 2 AND 3.  SEE THE
PAPER CITED ON THE *JRNL* RECORDS ABOVE.
;
